buitnzorg/.github - Organization Configuration Repository
========================================================

This is the special .github repository for the buitnzorg organization.

Purpose:
--------
This repository serves as the central location for organization-wide
configuration files and community health documents that will be used
across all repositories in the buitnzorg organization.

What this repository can contain:
---------------------------------
- Default community health files (CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, etc.)
- Issue and pull request templates
- Workflow templates for GitHub Actions
- Organization profile README (in profile/ directory)
- Security policies and guidelines

Repository Structure:
--------------------
- Root directory: Contains default community health files
- .github/workflows/: Organization-wide workflow templates
- profile/: Contains the organization's public profile content

This repository helps maintain consistency and provides default
configurations that will be inherited by other repositories in
the organization when they don't have their own versions of these files.

For more information about .github repositories, see:
https://docs.github.com/en/communities/setting-up-your-project-for-healthy-contributions/creating-a-default-community-health-file